#Deloitte DevOps Engineer Interview Questions Complete Technical Experience

One of my Friend recently given an interview to hashtag#Deloitte.

Round 1: Technical Screening

Explain your end-to-end CI/CD workflow. Which type of Jenkins pipeline do you use and why?
Difference between Declarative and Scripted Jenkins pipelines.
How do you define and trigger Jenkins pipelines?
What are Jenkins Shared Libraries? How are they structured and used in Jenkinsfiles?
What types of applications have you deployed using Jenkins pipelines?
Which deployment tools have you used (Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, Terraform)?
If a Jenkins pipeline runs but the build does not trigger, what could be the reasons?
What is a webhook, and how is it used in a CI/CD pipeline?
How do you create and manage Kubernetes clusters using Terraform?
What is the role of the master (control plane) and worker nodes?
What common Kubernetes errors have you faced (CrashLoopBackOff, ImagePullBackOff), and how did you resolve them?
How do you access a running pod, and how do you define Kubernetes objects?
Explain the folder structure of a Helm chart.
What are the stages involved in building a Docker image?
What is the difference between ENTRYPOINT and CMD in Docker?
How do you connect and manage services such as Databases, EC2, EKS, and ECS?
What is the command used to connect to a running ECS container?
Which container registry do you use to store Docker images?

Round 2: In-Depth Technical Screening

Which branching strategy do you follow (GitFlow / Trunk-based), and how do you avoid breaking the release branch?
If a critical bug is found in production, what is your approach to fixing it?
Explain your complete deployment workflow from code commit to production.
What stages do you define in your Jenkins pipeline to ensure code quality?
How do you design and reuse Jenkins Shared Libraries?
How do you perform Docker image vulnerability scanning during build time and at the registry level?
Which security tools or plugins have you used for image scanning?
How do you pass environment variables during Docker build and runtime?
Which services or registries do you use to store Docker images?
How do you establish secure connections with databases?
How do you authenticate to EKS clusters and securely manage secrets?
How do you create and deploy AWS Lambda functions?
What are the different ways to push artifacts to AWS Lambda?
What is email signing and Helm chart signing? Which tools are used?
